## 17. Definition of Done

This change is complete only when:
- The Element Library is registry-driven, searchable, accessible, and covers the required categories.
- Icon, Logo, and Image workflows are distinct and usable.
- Users can save and reuse editable Components and Templates.
- Header/Footer can be configured independently per page as Global, Local, or None.
- Global and Local edit propagation matches the documented rules.
- All features work across Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile.
- Save, Publish, Update, Unpublish, and Rollback semantics remain consistent with the existing architecture.
- Publishing validates all page/component/asset dependencies and activates atomically.
- Canonical source data remains in the user's Google Workspace; Supabase remains Authentication-only.
- Security, failure recovery, and acceptance tests pass.
